Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-28-2001||01:22 PM||||True story, just happen to me this today !!<BR>I was going to take my Cherokee out for a drive, only to find the keys missing.<P>I tore apart my room / ripped the sheets off the bed, threw them in the washer, looked under everything. Threw out that junk pile I'd made, that I'd never gotten the chance to throw out.<P>Well I was dumbfounded, could not find them anywhere.<P>I looked in the Cherokeee, and my daily driver, threw out more trash from there.<P>Still no keys. Man was I pissed. I cleaned up the house & car, but no key. Hmmmm where could they be.<P>Naw, they couldn't be in the Fiero, I'd never put them in there. Where else can I look ? Not on the countertops, where oh where.....<P>Well, lets look in the Fiero, well what the...what is this ? how'd they get in here. Was my Fiero play hide & seek with me ?<P>There they were laying right on the passenger seat !!<P>I never put anything in the Fiero, It must have been a game it was playing on me !!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBluesig.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 12-28-2001).]||||reg||4
